      "message": "Can we detect string literal for this case?\n-------------\nPlease fix this WARNING reported by autoreview issue finding: There is no way to set a string literal variable to `\"true\"` or `\"false\"` using this parser. It will always be parsed as a boolean. This is a subtle limitation/gotcha that might be worth noting.",
